# Eval run logs. The per-run JSON summaries under
# `experiments/034-eval-harness/results/<label>/` ARE committed — they are the
# references later runs are scored against — but the raw pipeline logs beside
# them are not, and never have been (0 of them are tracked). They are also
# ~10 GB, so with nothing ignoring them every `git status` listed them and a
# `git add -A` at the repo root would have tried to commit all of it.
experiments/034-eval-harness/results/*/*.log
experiments/034-eval-harness/results/*/*.stdout

# Local dev environment and host-specific planning notes: not project
